{"type":"运行JS代码","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"repeatCount":1,"desc":"V5日志｜进入其他植物分支","jsCode":"(function(){var p=\"\/sdcard\/Download\/收割预检诊断.txt\";try{var old=\"\";try{old=String(zdjl.readFile(p)||\"\");}catch(e){}var g=function(k){try{return String(zdjl.getVar(k,\"global\")||\"\");}catch(e){return \"?\";}};zdjl.writeFile(p,(old+\"\\n收割V5-20261010 | \"+new Date().toISOString()+\" | 进入其他植物分支 | \"+g(\"收割预检植物结论\")+\"\/\"+g(\"收割预检成熟结论\")).slice(-25000));}catch(e){}try{zdjl.toast(\"收割V5｜进入其他植物分支\",1250);}catch(e){} })();"}
